{"id":"7592f81d26ce6b6b","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-lem-elementary-chain.md","title":"Elementary Chain Lemma","display":"lem-elementary-chain — Elementary Chain Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-elementary-chain","aliases":["58-lem-elementary-chain"],"display":"lem-elementary-chain — Elementary Chain Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-elementary-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-elementary-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-elementary-chain — Elementary Chain Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> is the imported limit-ordinal predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\)</span> are the imported common-language structure predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the imported typed set-function predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_i\">\\(\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_i\\)</span> is the componentwise union structure: its universe and every relation/function interpretation are the unions of the coherent interpretations in the chain</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet))\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{j&lt;\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L\\right)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\!\\left(\n\\mathfrak A_i,\\bigcup_{j&lt;\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet))\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{j&lt;\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L\\right)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\!\\left(\n\\mathfrak A_i,\\bigcup_{j&lt;\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sequence, common language, limit index, and componentwise union\nstructure are now explicit in the theorem statement.</li>\n<li>The chain is a set function on the set ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>; the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is not used as a function codomain.</li>\n<li>Used in constructing elementary embeddings via transfinite recursion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{i<\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet))\n\\land\\forall i<\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall i<j<\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{j<\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L\\right)\n\\land\\forall i<\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\!\\left(\n\\mathfrak A_i,\\bigcup_{j<\\delta}^{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A_j,\\mathcal L\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1899,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3892","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-lem-elementary-chain.md|58-lem-elementary-chain]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["e91c1261e1c2374b","d9b8711cda3f31ca","81cabbac7fa4d75d","36d7463d215be751"]}